<BlogPostLayout
  title="How to Edit a Fake Chat Screenshot: Timestamps, Reactions & More"
  description="Edit every detail of a fake WhatsApp chat screenshot — message text, timestamps, reactions, voice notes, calls and avatars. Free, no watermark, no signup."
  heading="How to edit a fake chat screenshot"
  published="2026-08-03"
  publishedLabel="August 3, 2026"
  readingTime="7 min read"
